 on-chain bonus, v1 receiver layout.

(1) Aave v3.3 LiquidationLogic ON by default (Base Pool revision 11):
    100% close factor unless chosen collateral AND debt reserve >= $2k base and
    HF > 0.95; MustNotLeaveDust (MIN_LEFTOVER_BASE = $1k) handled by submitting
    full liquidatable debt when collateral-capped, or sizing down a 50% close
    that would strand < $1k collateral. AAVE_V33_LIQUIDATION_RULES=false restores
    legacy sizing. Constants cited from aave-v3-origin v3.3.0 + main.
(2) Base pairs: all 6 permutations of WETH/USDC/cbBTC (validated vs Aave MCP +
    Pool.getConfiguration 2026-09-28; fixture records LT/bonus/fees, Chainlink
    feeds, Uniswap V3 pools). defaultDebtToCoverWei ~$1 legacy placeholder only.
    0xf20e @ 51765799 now selects cbBTC debt / USDC collateral, 100% close
    (11 sats, $0.0092), still dust-rejected by the $50 floor.
(3) Liquidation bonus + protocol fee read on-chain in the batched reserve
    multicall (eMode-aware via getEModeCategoryCollateralConfig/Bitmap); missing
    => liquidation_bonus_unavailable_skip (fail closed, no config fallback).
    estimateMinimumCollateralOut fixed: returned debt-token raw units labelled as
    collateral (and re-applied close factor, ignored price ratio/protocol fee).
    Phase-2 dry run now sizes via AaveSnapshotProvider/planAaveLiquidation.
(A) Aave flash route back on the live v1 receiver 5-field layout (8cbab38 sent
    the 7-field MultiProtocol layout => DebtAssetMismatch / empty revert).
    Readiness pins the receiver runtime code hash (LIQUIDATION_RECEIVER_CODEHASH,
    default v1 hash for 0x379c...ada6) and runs a v1 layout probe
    (executeOperation from Pool must revert HealthFactorNotBelowThreshold /
    HF_NOT_LIQUIDATABLE); any mismatch or RPC error blocks LIVE.
